      "type": "paragraph",
      "section": "LOANS PAYABLE",
      "text": "Certain debts can be converted into the Company’s Common Stock at a 20% discount (10% in case of Othership conversion). The total number of shares issuable for convertible debt is 0 as of June 30, 2026. This assumes all potentially convertible debt was converted as of June 30, 2026. Other assumptions include a common stock market price of $2.29 USD or $1.646 per share on June 30, 2026, and a USD to Canadian dollar conversion rate $3.14 as listed on https://www.wsj.com/market-data/quotes/fx/USDCAD/historical-prices on that date.",
      "alignment": "left",
      "bold": false,
      "italic": false
