      "type": "paragraph",
      "section": "DIRECTORS AND OFFICERS STOCK COMPENSATION",
      "text": "The Preferred Shares issued to Shaun Passley, PhD on January 16, 2025 were issued as bonus compensation for services rendered to the Company. The fair value of these shares was recognized as share-based compensation expense.",
